meta {
  name: PATCH Center Associate
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{baseURL}}/centers/associates/{{associate_id}}/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-Center-ID: {{center_id}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "role_ids": ["{{role_id}}"],
    "is_active": true
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Update center associate assignment. pk = associate UUID (same as list id). Center from X-Center-ID, not URL.
  
  HARD-BREAK: write `role_ids` UUID[] only (no `role_id`). Response: `role_ids` + nested `roles[]` (no singular `role` / `role_id`).
  Omit role_ids = leave unchanged; [] / null = clear. Admin associates cannot have care roles.
  Roles must be active for this center (or system); inactive → 400.
  
  Care-staff flag: is_care_staff.
  Status: is_active (user active flag).
  
  PATCH partial — send only fields to change.
  
  Auth: bearer {{access_token}}. Set env center_id, associate_id, role_id (sample UUID for role_ids[]).
}
